<TUV xml:lang='ja'>Blocksize</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>The maximum number of frames the receiver allows the sender to send, before waiting for an authorisation to continue transmission of the following frames.</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='de-DE'>Maximale Anzahl Frames, die der Empfänger dem Sender erlaubt zu senden, bevor dieser auf die Erlaubnis zum Senden der darauf folgenden Frames warten muß.</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='fr-FR'>The maximum number of frames the receiver allows the sender to send, before waiting for an authorisation to continue transmission of the following frames.</TUV>
<TUV xml:lang='ja'>The maximum number of frames the receiver allows the sender to send, before waiting for an authorisation to continue transmission of the following frames.</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DC.Blocksize</QUAL>
</UNSDEF>
